    "The development hereby permitted shall be commenced before the expiration of three years from the date of this permission.<br>",
    "&lt;p&gt;The development hereby approved shall only be carried out in accordance with the following approved plans and documents:&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;- A00 Location Plan and Existing Block Plan 11/03/2026&lt;br&gt;- A01 Proposed Block Plan 11/03/2026&lt;br&gt;- A03 Proposed Ground Floor Plan 11/03/2026&lt;br&gt;- A05 Proposed Building Elevations 11/03/2026&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;No other drawings or documents apply.&lt;/p&gt;",
    "<p class=\"MsoNormal\">The materials to be used in the construction of the external surfaces of the development hereby permitted shall match those used in the existing dwellinghouse.<br></p>",
